<title>USA: Snyder Oil names William Hargett president.</title>
<headline>Snyder Oil names William Hargett president.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Snyder Oil Corp said Wednesday it had named William Hargett president, chief operating officer and a director of the company.</p>
<p>The company said John Snyder will relinquish his position as interim president and will continue as chief executive and chairman.  </p>
<p>Hargett served as president and a director of Greenhill Petroleum Corp until the recent $270 million sale of that company to Mesa Inc, Snyder Oil said.</p>
